{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "032nao_402_2_4_032_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fefae547d0b78f22b34b346cf784a38ed38cd1307ae4799658435075fdedcdd9",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:032nao_402_2_4_032_02_09_a:2_4_032_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ed2335d036a817df54852b66f2dcc813d59b48b1608915984602a991c9d893a",
      "text": "辛苦了，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_402_2_4_032_02_09_a:2_4_032_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5f8829435636d958cfb69527ee16eb28e42ddd17031f991c91c8da6f854752e",
      "text": "下次要出演的节目问卷，\n我已经写完了，明天交给您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_402_2_4_032_02_09_a:2_4_032_02_09_a:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a49aed8c3546746d7a9eab999ec05dc69a9dfab816226b499a2e082a137e43d6",
      "text": "动作好快啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_402_2_4_032_02_09_a:2_4_032_02_09_a:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50d660498e538648808817f834197606bbc188f44e851e24ec2c77a5c850b72d",
      "text": "因为最近一直有《星球射手》的\n宣传活动，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_402_2_4_032_02_09_a:2_4_032_02_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd7d048620cb0758908503b78aa92ac31575237c35b9d83da193fc36fd9c89f6",
      "text": "开心的回忆和想说的事情\n有好多好多。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_402_2_4_032_02_09_a:2_4_032_02_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64751aa175f74807f97da6c74bc5e992ed97bde55146e3201666ac2168fd4eab",
      "text": "电影上映后，收到了很多感想，\n真的很开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_402_2_4_032_02_09_a:2_4_032_02_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddb0b50f42a3a1f32d03284818392c8802ff8fcc519cce2202e23ca89f491ce5",
      "text": "南河三是一个平时总是威风凛凛、对自己的工作\n充满自信的角色，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_402_2_4_032_02_09_a:2_4_032_02_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e23242d484478faa13c1dd24e3d38158231da75cfb6f3026ca5873cc717ed75",
      "text": "我之前还一直很不安，\n不知道自己有没有演出帅气的南河三……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_402_2_4_032_02_09_a:2_4_032_02_09_a:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3addbe91c0e14cff6ca7e3497f6cf1f1fa55ae366724737d0588f477d53a33e3",
      "text": "不过有粉丝在信里写道，看了南河三的活跃表现\n自己获得了勇气。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_402_2_4_032_02_09_a:2_4_032_02_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63b9244c8b0250ef6fa5621e1600f0af938ff63bbe6769ca11acad7fe63b02cb",
      "text": "看到那封信，我觉得自己已经把心意\n好好传达出去了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_402_2_4_032_02_09_a:2_4_032_02_09_a:cmd-000027:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55f3460aa54aa408c885dd019889486ec922a98908c9f8be40829e3ed832f27f",
      "text": "真的很帅气哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_402_2_4_032_02_09_a:2_4_032_02_09_a:cmd-000028:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f8ba0f289d37cd5c8acdda8843cc48a70c2a59be412558a0433682f1bd071f9",
      "text": "这是努力的成果呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_402_2_4_032_02_09_a:2_4_032_02_09_a:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:905cbaee099d0593e2d6249a25f607ad698548357dfd6a1b1d6f0566e5d66a03",
      "text": "谢谢您。虽然总觉得\n有点害羞，但还是很开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_402_2_4_032_02_09_a:2_4_032_02_09_a:cmd-000035:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3de1fc3f11083b5a764b46c48d822344b17a3e898602f412c1802c1893082be4",
      "text": "虽然很有难度，但能够克服真是太好了。\n非常感谢您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_402_2_4_032_02_09_a:2_4_032_02_09_a:cmd-000039:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4cabbb6457fcec8ecdab283286ee3b8d21d33e44ee9425f98885a450fed02506",
      "text": "今后要是需要勇气的时候，我想试着\n回想一下南河三。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_402_2_4_032_02_09_a:2_4_032_02_09_a:cmd-000041:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c95323100a26db90c956fb706045882048aa747c41a693f7943c3d2cc7b56ae9",
      "text": "下一项工作，我也同样会加油的。\n那么，明天见。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
